I've made an upgrade to the Tinfoil Hat patch produced by Malcom Ryan,
which has the following improvements:

* Tinfoil hats are generated in the dungeon at low probabilities, and
are usually cursed.
* Tinfoil hats now block clairvoyance.
* Tinfoil hats now block the telepathic quest message from your leader.

* Tinfoil hats now block Psi Bolt.
* Monsters wearing tinfoil hats are imperceptible to telepathic
players.
* Improved the behaviour of monster-to-monster mind blasts a bit.
* Tinfoil hats now have a tile (whether or not it works, though, has
yet to be demonstrated.)

It doesn't yet fix the mutual exclusivity of metal and flimsiness,
though...

